zingtouch.min.js is the VERBATIM dist/zingtouch.min.js from the pinned npm
package. LICENSE is its verbatim MIT license. provenance.json records the
verified npm tarball SHA-512 integrity and both vendored file SHA-256 hashes.
The lockfile pins the same package; integrity tests compare the installed
npm distribution against these files. No runtime CDN or network is used.

The official bundle retains its sourceMappingURL comment. No map is shipped:
normal gameplay makes no request; devtools may look for the optional debug map.
Only this unmodified third-party vendor directory is excluded from AISLOP.
All authored integration, build, input, core and tests remain in scan scope.

1.0.6 uses TouchEvent in browsers with both touch and pointer APIs. Its Region
has no native cancel hook. web/gestures.js adds scoped cancellation and clears
Region.state.resetInputs() without changing this bundle. It registers built-in
Tap, Pan, Swipe plus a custom Gesture for stationary hold start/end. Pinch,
rotation and additional contacts do not control the game.
